{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/51043-guilty-shaken-spooked-alternatives-and-interpretations","id":51043,"title":"Guilty, Shaken + Spooked Alternatives and Interpretations...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-16T14:06:15-08:00","id":51043,"title":"Guilty, Shaken + Spooked Alternatives and Interpretations...","content":"So having played a LOT of this game lately, we've seen quite a few compromise rolls!<br /> <br /> So many, in fact, that sometimes my players are filling up on Conditions... IE, getting Guilty, Shaken AND spooked, all at the same time!<br /> <br /> Is it possible to have multiple instances of these Conditions?<br /> <br /> And; hey! Anybody got any good ideas for FURTHER conditions like this to be taken on a Compromise roll? We're feeling a bit... I dunno, constrained? Sometimes, we really struggle to come up with good versions of those Conditions that are appropriate to the compromise.<br /> <br /> In fact, I kinda have a hard time grocking how specifically these emotional shifts are related to some compromises - in particular, like, offscreen True Form shifts? Help me understand how these make people Guilty, Shaken or Spooked. I've tried to 'stretch' it... saying stuff like, 'well you feel the wandering eye of the machine, so it spooked you'... but it can feel a bit, I dunno, weird.<br /> <br /> Any tips?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T14:11:14-08:00","id":51048,"title":"","content":"You can make up conditions on your own for whatever you feel appropriate, GMC is all about that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T14:31:36-08:00","id":51070,"title":"","content":"Don't forget you can take temporary glitches in place of Conditions!<br /> <br /> (Pretty sure that Guilty, at least, can be instanced - confessing to shoplifting isn't going to ease your conscience about the murders you committed last summer, after all.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T22:01:23-08:00","id":55243,"title":"","content":"Well, it might. Perhaps you've been feeling guilty, torn, all that time, not even caring that you stole, lied, did things. Nothing overshadowed that act. Nothing made you react.<br /> Then, one day, you just felt and urge to do better, and your first step towards that better was to confess, to pay the store back. Suddenly, because you knew you were heading towards something finer, the world didn't seem as bleak anymore. You no longer felt guilty.<br /> You felt like you had a purpose, and set about it with renewed vigor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}